Haakon Studebaker wrote:

> An amulet of reincarnation.

I like that alot. If it's made to replace it, it takes some power from 
the "oLS and makes you change direction in the game as the price to pay 
for life-saving. Quite interesting.

The quest is not a problem--you are the same person, just in a different 
body. You will still have the same gods and quest. (It would be wrong to 
adjust the quest in any case, as you won't have any previous life, if 
"reincarnated" in this way.)

